<section class="quick-start">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Quick Start</h2>

        <div class="quick-start-content">
            <div class="quick-start-step">
                <h3><span class="step-number">1</span> Get Your GitHub Token</h3>
                <p>Create a personal access token with <code>repo</code>, <code>read:org</code>, and <code>admin:org</code> scopes.</p>
                <a href="https://github.com/settings/tokens/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-small">Create Token</a>
            </div>

            <div class="quick-start-step">
                <h3><span class="step-number">2</span> Run Analysis</h3>
                <p>Use npx to run the tool without installation:</p>
                <pre><code class="language-bash">npx @sdh100shaun/hubhelper analyze \
  --org your-org-name \
  --token your-github-token</code></pre>
            </div>

            <div class="quick-start-step">
                <h3><span class="step-number">3</span> Review Results</h3>
                <p>View security issues in your terminal or export to JSON/HTML:</p>
                <pre><code class="language-bash">npx @sdh100shaun/hubhelper analyze \
  --org your-org \
  --html report.html</code></pre>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="quick-start-cta">
            <p>Ready to get started?</p>
            <a href="{{ '/pages/getting-started/' | url }}" class="btn btn-primary">Read the Full Guide</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

